  "A factor can measure a pattern without predicting a later move, and an apparent prediction can lose its edge after costs. Read each gate separately. A failed or unevaluated gate is a limitation, not a positive recommendation.": "因子可以衡量某種模式，卻不能預測後續變動；預測優勢也可能被成本抵銷。請分別檢查每道門檻。失敗或未評估表示限制，不代表正面推薦。",
  "A factor measures a defined property. Rank IC is a rank correlation used to evaluate predictive information. Measure, incremental information, prediction, net cost and consistency are separate research gates.": "因子衡量定義明確的屬性。秩 IC 是評估預測資訊的秩相關係數。衡量、增量資訊、預測、淨成本和一致性是不同的研究門檻。",
  "A research stance is a recorded relative position within an asset pool, never an instruction to place an order. A composite score combines weighted factor measurements. A higher score does not establish lower risk or a profitable future return.": "研究立場是資產池內記錄的相對位置，不是下單指令。綜合分數結合加權因子測量。分數較高不能證明風險較低或未來獲利。",
  "A signal can describe today's market well and still predict nothing. A factor can predict and still lose its edge to costs. A strategy can make money for a reason other than the one in its name.": "訊號可能很好地描述今天的市場，卻無法預測。因子可能具備預測力，但成本會抵銷優勢。策略獲利的原因也可能與名稱暗示的不同。",
  "A signed contribution shows how a recorded factor enters the score. A negative contribution does not prove a negative future return. Coverage describes available data, not confidence.": "帶正負號的貢獻表示因子如何進入分數。負貢獻不能證明未來報酬為負。覆蓋率代表資料可用性，不是信心程度。",
