  "Synthetic gate outcomes and measurements are generated independently. Reported outcomes are displayed as supplied, even when a value and threshold appear inconsistent.": "合成門檻結果與測量值獨立生成。即使數值與門檻看似不一致，仍依來源原樣顯示結果。",
  "The as-of date is the decision context, not today's date. SYNTHETIC means fictional instruments and generated numbers. REPLAY uses sample data and recorded model answers. REAL identifies source-reported live data and calls.": "決策日期是資料背景，不是今天的日期。SYNTHETIC表示虛構標的與生成數值；REPLAY使用樣本資料和已記錄的模型回答；REAL表示來源報告的真實資料與呼叫。",
