  "The first instrument by reported rank in each pool. These are research examples, not personalized selections. Scores are ranked within each pool, not compared across pools.": "各資產池中依報告排名最前的標的。這些是研究範例，不是個人化選擇。分數僅在各池內排名，不跨池比較。",
