  "These are the conditions recorded by the source. They are not a complete assessment of suitability or investment risk. {value1}": "這些條件來自來源記錄，不構成完整的適合度或投資風險評估。{value1}",
  "These are the original recorded claims and checks. A verified claim is not a guarantee of future returns. Rejected claims remain visible and must not be treated as supporting evidence.": "以下是原始記錄的聲明與檢查。「已驗證」不保證未來報酬。被拒絕聲明保持可見，但不得視為支持證據。",
